Subject: R4, static exception messages
Reason: Four messages embedded input that can come from a request (the attestation fmt, json_last_error_msg(), the sprintf'd CBOR simple value and major type); every message is now a static string with its code kept, so nothing from a request can reach a log or response through a message (Plugin Check still flags the class-constant code argument, see 0008).

